title: vcvt.u32.f64 edge cases: negatives give 0, too large gives 0xFFFFFFFF, NaN gives 0
ref: A8.8 VCVT, VCVTR (between floating-point and integer) T1; A2.7 FPToFixed() unsigned with round_zero: -0.9 rounds towards zero to 0, -1.0 saturates to 0, SatQ() unsigned

